"""SEN0401 chapter 9 (Transaction Fees): the taxonomy of the chapter as data, one row per leaf:
(top, mid, leaf, example, definition, expression, expected repr).  Every expression is executed by sen0401_rdodi_checks (cwd = the repository root) and its printed repr must equal
the expected one; the expressions read the saved sources (ch09-evidence), the two regtest records (Bitcoin Core 31.1) and the mainnet census through sen0401_ch09_lib_v1_0_0.
A leaf with expected repr None is a claim that the chapter takes from a source and does not recompute (listed as such in the report)."""
__version__ = "1.0.1"
